@startuml
' issue #2679: RoundCorner had no effect at all on a partition (border and
' background were both always drawn as a plain square-cornered rectangle).
' Pins the fix: both the border and the background fill are now rounded,
' using the new dedicated "partition" style selector (see #2679's own
' resolution: partition is no longer aliased to "group").
<style>
sequenceDiagram {
  partition {
    RoundCorner 20
  }
}
</style>
actor User
participant System

partition Setup
User -> System : init()
end
@enduml
